      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 52 of the principal Act is amended by deleting the words “or traffic warden” wherever appearing. Amendment of section 53a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 53a(1) of the principal Act is amended in the English language text, by substituting for the word “shall” the word “may”. Amendment of section 65"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_12__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_12__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 65 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_12__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsections (1), (3), (5), (6) and (7), by inserting after the words “the Perbadanan Putrajaya” wherever appearing the words “, the President of a Municipal Council, the Chairman of a Municipal Council”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_12__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_12",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (4), by inserting after paragraph (c) the following paragraph: “(ca) the President of a Municipal Council or the Chairman of a Municipal Council, if the motor vehicle was caused to be removed by a traffic warden or any officer in the service of the Municipal Council;”. Amendment of section 120"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_13",
