      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words “or the Perbadanan Putrajaya” the words “, the Perbadanan Putrajaya, the President of a Municipal Council or the Chairman of a Municipal Council”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_2__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the national language text, by substituting for the full stop a semicolon; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “President” the following definition: ‘ “President of a Municipal Council” means the President as defined in section 2 of the Local Government Act 1976 [Act 171].’. Amendment of section 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 3 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the national language text, in subsection (4), by substituting for the word “beberapa” the words “sekian bilangan”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (4a) the following subsection: “(4b) The President of a Municipal Council or the Chairman of a Municipal Council may appoint such number of persons in the service of the Municipal Council as he considers necessary or expedient for the purposes of this Act to be traffic wardens and may, after consultation with the Inspector General of Police, prescribe uniforms for such officers.”. Amendment of section 3a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
