      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_4__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “Mayor of a City Council” the following definition:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 4 the following section: “Powers and duties of Dato Bandar, the Perbadanan Putrajaya, President of Municipal Council, etc. 4. The powers and duties of the Dato Bandar, the Perbadanan Putrajaya, President of a Municipal Council, the Chairman of a Municipal Council and traffic wardens under this Act shall not be exercised outside or in respect of offences committed outside the Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur, the Federal Territory of Putrajaya or outside the jurisdiction of the Municipal Council, respectively.”. Amendment of section 17"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/10/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 17(1) of the principal Act is amended by renumbering paragraphs (bb) and (bc) as paragraphs (ba) and (bb) respectively. Amendment of section 35"
      }
    },
